task: durable per-project task state exposed over MCP by ProxyServer — state.get, state.update (RFC 7396 JSON Merge Patch), state.reset — backed by a JSON file at <project>/.rozum/state.json (project resolved via detect_project(), same as the cwd-project room). Mirrors okay's StateMcp (Scala) design point for point, native to this project's own rmcp-based proxy.
